# Cloud Functions Environment Variables
# These are set via environment variables (Spark plan compatible)

# VERIFICATION_SIGNING_SECRET (32+ characters)
# Used for HMAC-SHA256 signing of verification challenges
# Example: openssl rand -base64 32

# AUTHENTICATOR_ENROLLMENT_SECRET (32+ characters)
# Used for authenticator device registration
# Example: openssl rand -base64 32

# HEALTH_ADMIN_SECRET (32+ characters)
# Used for health endpoint authentication
# Example: openssl rand -base64 32

# APP_MASTER_SECRET (48+ characters, min 32)
# Root of trust for multi-tenant app registry (registerApp/revokeApp)
# Used to validate app registration requests and hash API keys
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 48
# Example: APP_MASTER_SECRET=

# ACTIVE_DEDICATED_NUMBER (E.164 format)
# The phone number of the dedicated authenticator device
# Example: +8801XXXXXXXXX
